\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. JESUS, to Thy table led,
\par Now let every heart be fed
\par With the true and living Bread.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. While in penitence we kneel,
\par Thy sweet presence let us feel,
\par All Thy wondrous love reveal.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. While on Thy dear Cross we gaze,
\par Morning o'er our sinful ways,
\par Turn our sadness into praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. When we taste the mystic wine,
\par Of Thine outpoured blood the sign,
\par Fill our hearts with love divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Draw us to Thy wounded side,
\par Whence there flowed the healing tide;
\par There our sins and sorrows hide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. From the bonds of sin release,
\par Cold and wavering faith increase,
\par Lamb of God, grant us Thy peace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Lead us by Thy pierced hand
\par Till around Thy throne we stand
\par In the bright and better land.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

